    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1176">

                <pb facs="0864" n="788" sameAs="frus:frus1916/pg788"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 812.113/3895</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Consular Agent Sawday
                        to the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Consular Agency</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Ensenada</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1916-01-30T14:00:00-07:48">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">January 30, 1916, 2 p.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Department’s January 21, 6 p.m. Shipments should be confined to immediate
                    requirement of known mining operations and public works.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Sawday</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
